/// Immutable, digest-pinned glyph bytes for the app-owned Varela v1 bundle.
///
/// This API never opens files or fetches URLs. The application must derive the
/// installation root from its private support directory, verify installed files,
/// and retain them for renderer use. These bytes only seed the offline database;
